{"id": "34201", "title": "嫁到风流王子", "author": "白双", "category": "文学名著", "count": 49, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34201/34201s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34201.htm", "intro": "这程咬金未免也太狂妄了吧？不仅大闹她的“相亲宴”，还在街上强吻她！真是可恶！他以为她曲薇丹是好惹的吗？下次碰面一定要他好看！喝～～不会吧？上次那名无礼的家伙竟是她有钱的房东？啊～～饶了她吧！他居然还是她神龙不见尾的顶头上司？难道她是被诅咒了？大小衰事皆“有志一同”的来找她……没错！她就是被诅咒了！她这头号女强人竟被迫要嫁给她的上司──亚德·奥。因为她所佩戴的蓝钻石，就是奥氏家族的诅咒之石──“月蓝海” 不过……那个亚德是出了名的坏男人、风流胚，她真的要嫁给他吗？虽然他高唱婚姻是可笑的束缚，虽然他蔑视她是荷尔蒙失调的老处女，可她好像不怎么排斥他，好像是爱上他了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34201", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2173010.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2173011.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2173012.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2173013.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2173014.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2173015.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2173016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2173017.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2173018.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2173019.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2173020.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2173021.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2173022.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2173023.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2173024.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2173025.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2173026.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2173027.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2173028.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2173029.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2173030.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2173031.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2173032.html", "available": false}